This PR changes the Plugin Frontend to return the types passed into the `get()` and `remove()` methods, which is much more convenient and eliminates a potential `cast` on the user side. For example, this: 

```haxe
var plugin:MyPlugin = cast FlxG.plugins.get(MyPlugin);
plugin.myPluginMethod();
```
becomes:
```haxe
var plugin = FlxG.plugins.get(MyPlugin);
plugin.myPluginMethod();
```

